
# Open Hepsiburada and login with <user> and <pass>

// Visit The Website And Accept the cookies
* Go To "websiteURL"
* Click On "cookieAcceptButtonId" on shadow root "cookieShadowRoot"

// Navigate The login Page
* Find Element Where "myAccountButtonId" then click
* Find Element Where "loginButtonId" then click

// Enter UserName & Password
* Find Failed "usernameFieldId" then fill with "username"
* Find Failed "passwordFieldId" then fill with "password"
* Find Element Where "loginSubmitButtonId" then click
//* important delay for "30" seconds

// Verify that we logged in by checking the acctount button in header
* Verify Element "loggedInAccountXpath"
* Assertion|Verify User Logged In Successfully

